# Third-party plugin, reinstallable from the Asset Store or GitHub (see
# docs/KNOWN_LIMITATIONS.md) — kept out of history rather than committing
# ~100 MB of vendored assets.
Assets/SteamVR/
Assets/SteamVR.meta

# SteamVR's own generated companions to the plugin above. Unused by this
# project (no SteamVR Input/behaviour system is added to any scene) and
# regenerated automatically whenever the plugin is present — see
# docs/KNOWN_LIMITATIONS.md. Note Assets/SteamVR_Resources/ (singular
# settings, holding autoEnableVR: 0) is NOT excluded here — that one is a real,
# load-bearing project setting, not disposable scaffolding.
Assets/StreamingAssets/SteamVR/
Assets/StreamingAssets/SteamVR.meta
Assets/XR/Loaders/OpenVRLoader.asset
Assets/XR/Loaders/OpenVRLoader.asset.meta
Assets/XR/Settings/OpenVRSettings.asset
Assets/XR/Settings/OpenVRSettings.asset.meta
